      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Preprocessor (normalisation)\nrepair quotes · rewrite paraphrases · strip trailing clause\nfind title mentions: exact → without article → fuzzy (OSA),\nranked films first, then degree\nunknown longer title (Don't Look Up)? → clarify\nnegation: not / never / n't, title words masked\nanswer class noun: actors / directors\n→ Plan: negated, universe = director, films = [Jaws, Alien]",
      "originalText": "Preprocessor (normalisation)\nrepair quotes · rewrite paraphrases · strip trailing clause\nfind title mentions: exact → without article → fuzzy (OSA),\nranked films first, then degree\nunknown longer title (Don't Look Up)? → clarify\nnegation: not / never / n't, title words masked\nanswer class noun: actors / directors\n→ Plan: negated, universe = director, films = [Jaws, Alien]",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "pre",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
